<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-SPRINGBOK ITINERARY CONFIRMED.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SPRINGBOK ITINERARY CONFIRMED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Rugby</p>
<p>Football Union (SARFU) on Monday confirmed the itinerary for a</p>
<p>tour of Argentina, France and Wales: </p>
<p>November 5 v Rosario, Rosario (Argentina)</p>
<p>		 9 v Argentina, Buenos Aires</p>
<p>		12 v Mendoza, Mendoza</p>
<p>		16 v Argentina, Buenos Aires</p>
<p>		23 v French Barbarians, Brive</p>
<p>		26 v Provincial selection, Lyon</p>
<p>		30 v France, Bordeaux</p>
<p>December 3 v Provincial selection, Lille</p>
<p>		 7 v France, Paris</p>
<p>		15 v Wales, Cardiff</p>
</text>
